            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/f9dbeb96b944323e4b4bb59f299dbecd.avif?t=1788209882\" width=600 height=134 /></span><br>The award winning tongue-in-cheek virtual reality experience that put the ‘fun’ in “funemployment” In a world where robots have replaced all human jobs, step into the &quot;Job Simulator&quot; to learn what it was like 'to job'.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/6cf5651c86a58acda34a5d6570f3eadf.poster.avif?t=1788209882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/6cf5651c86a58acda34a5d6570f3eadf.webm?t=1788209882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/6cf5651c86a58acda34a5d6570f3eadf.mp4?t=1788209882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/6a744d521644d74d0fd28a91bb058690.avif?t=1788209882\" width=600 height=515 /></span><br><br><i>“Riotously funny” – Rock Paper Shotgun</i><br><br><i>“The perfect demo for VR” – The Verge</i><br><br><i>“It all felt natural and intuitive (and fun and ridiculous).” – Wired</i><br><br><i>“I was grinning like a lunatic the whole time.” – The Telegraph</i><br><br><i>“I never expected a video game … in which I grabbed a tomato (and threw it at a robot) to awe me so deeply. I … wanna play Job Simulator forever.” – IGN</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to JOB! </h2>Relive humanity’s glory days by simulating the irreverent ins-and-outs of being an <strong>office worker</strong>, a <strong>gourmet chef</strong>, a <strong>convenience store clerk</strong>, and more. Dream it, think it, try it – (almost) anything is possible!<br><br>💼 Learn to 'job' across a variety of not-so historically accurate recreations of work-life, before society was automated by robots!   <br>🙌 Use your hands to stack, manipulate, throw, and smash physics objects in absurdly satisfying ways!   <br>🪓 Show your leadership potential by throwing staplers at your boss!<br>☕ Aggressively chug coffee and eat questionable food from the trash!<br>👔 Gain invaluable life skills by firing quirky new employees, serving slushy treats, brewing a proper cup of tea, and ripping apart car engines with style! <br>🌙 NEW! Embrace the unending night shift with the wild and never-ending Infinite Overtime mode!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now Included: Infinite Overtime!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/1c568cd3571772794ef3b943d22dc6df.avif?t=1788209882\" width=512 height=292 /></span><br><br>Work the never-ending night shift with Infinite Overtime mode, a free content update to Job Simulator! Enjoy a dynamic, randomly generated workload while you grind for promotions – just like real life!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy Social VR!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/626f79e75341c1f11697ef6a02ca9b16.poster.avif?t=1788209882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/626f79e75341c1f11697ef6a02ca9b16.webm?t=1788209882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/626f79e75341c1f11697ef6a02ca9b16.mp4?t=1788209882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Introducing a brand new way to allow players to share their experience! Check out Spectator Mode – a fun and easy way to jump into Social VR! It’s better ‘to job’ with friends – Twitch integration allows you to view, move, scale, and throw your chat in-game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR for Everyone - No Excuses!</h2>Owlchemy Labs is an XR studio with a passion for polished, playful VR games and experiences. We love building experiences for everyone: oozing with style, absurdly funny, and with ground-breaking accessibility to bring more joy to more people.<br><br>As part of this mission, we are proud to offer our players best-in-class accessibility options such as rich subtitles and broad language support for both <i>Job Simulator</i> and our <i>Infinite Overtime</i> game update.<br><br><br><i>Created for you by your friends at Owlchemy Labs. Thanks for playing our games and letting us know what you think!</i>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/f9dbeb96b944323e4b4bb59f299dbecd.avif?t=1788209882\" width=600 height=134 /></span><br>The award winning tongue-in-cheek virtual reality experience that put the ‘fun’ in “funemployment” In a world where robots have replaced all human jobs, step into the &quot;Job Simulator&quot; to learn what it was like 'to job'.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/6cf5651c86a58acda34a5d6570f3eadf.poster.avif?t=1788209882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/6cf5651c86a58acda34a5d6570f3eadf.webm?t=1788209882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/6cf5651c86a58acda34a5d6570f3eadf.mp4?t=1788209882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/6a744d521644d74d0fd28a91bb058690.avif?t=1788209882\" width=600 height=515 /></span><br><br><i>“Riotously funny” – Rock Paper Shotgun</i><br><br><i>“The perfect demo for VR” – The Verge</i><br><br><i>“It all felt natural and intuitive (and fun and ridiculous).” – Wired</i><br><br><i>“I was grinning like a lunatic the whole time.” – The Telegraph</i><br><br><i>“I never expected a video game … in which I grabbed a tomato (and threw it at a robot) to awe me so deeply. I … wanna play Job Simulator forever.” – IGN</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to JOB! </h2>Relive humanity’s glory days by simulating the irreverent ins-and-outs of being an <strong>office worker</strong>, a <strong>gourmet chef</strong>, a <strong>convenience store clerk</strong>, and more. Dream it, think it, try it – (almost) anything is possible!<br><br>💼 Learn to 'job' across a variety of not-so historically accurate recreations of work-life, before society was automated by robots!   <br>🙌 Use your hands to stack, manipulate, throw, and smash physics objects in absurdly satisfying ways!   <br>🪓 Show your leadership potential by throwing staplers at your boss!<br>☕ Aggressively chug coffee and eat questionable food from the trash!<br>👔 Gain invaluable life skills by firing quirky new employees, serving slushy treats, brewing a proper cup of tea, and ripping apart car engines with style! <br>🌙 NEW! Embrace the unending night shift with the wild and never-ending Infinite Overtime mode!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now Included: Infinite Overtime!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/1c568cd3571772794ef3b943d22dc6df.avif?t=1788209882\" width=512 height=292 /></span><br><br>Work the never-ending night shift with Infinite Overtime mode, a free content update to Job Simulator! Enjoy a dynamic, randomly generated workload while you grind for promotions – just like real life!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy Social VR!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/626f79e75341c1f11697ef6a02ca9b16.poster.avif?t=1788209882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/626f79e75341c1f11697ef6a02ca9b16.webm?t=1788209882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448280/extras/626f79e75341c1f11697ef6a02ca9b16.mp4?t=1788209882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Introducing a brand new way to allow players to share their experience! Check out Spectator Mode – a fun and easy way to jump into Social VR! It’s better ‘to job’ with friends – Twitch integration allows you to view, move, scale, and throw your chat in-game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR for Everyone - No Excuses!</h2>Owlchemy Labs is an XR studio with a passion for polished, playful VR games and experiences. We love building experiences for everyone: oozing with style, absurdly funny, and with ground-breaking accessibility to bring more joy to more people.<br><br>As part of this mission, we are proud to offer our players best-in-class accessibility options such as rich subtitles and broad language support for both <i>Job Simulator</i> and our <i>Infinite Overtime</i> game update.<br><br><br><i>Created for you by your friends at Owlchemy Labs. Thanks for playing our games and letting us know what you think!</i>",
